/* ── Element spec ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  3D MODEL (right panel)
   stereocenter C (x2)      → SphereGeometry(0.38)  MeshPhong #4b5058 glossy
   stereocenter H (x2)      → SphereGeometry(0.20)  MeshPhong #7cc0e8
   hydroxyl O (x2)          → SphereGeometry(0.34)  MeshPhong #b23225
   hydroxyl H (x2)          → SphereGeometry(0.20)  MeshPhong #8f231a
   carboxyl C/O/O (x2 sets) → SphereGeometry(0.34)  MeshPhong #3fbf5c
