Here is the generated code to evaluate:

<!-- @FIGURE_UI_BEGIN -->
<div style="font-weight:700;margin-top:2px">Representation</div>
<div style="display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap">
  <button id="mStruct">Structure only</button>
